Subtask 1.6: Understanding Smart Inventory Filter Syntax
Smart inventory filters support various operators and syntax patterns:

Basic Operators:

# Exact match
server_type:web

# Not equal
server_type:!database

# Greater than or equal
memory_gb:>=8

# Less than
cpu_cores:<8

# Contains (for string values)
hostname:web*

# Regular expressions
hostname:~web-server-[0-9]+
Logical Operators:

# AND operation
server_type:web and environment:production

# OR operation
server_type:web or server_type:application

# Complex combinations
(server_type:web or server_type:application) and environment:production
